("v4", "type", "String")
("v4", "scalar", "Use case: stylized-concept.\nAsset type: a wide editorial cover image for a long philosophical article about trust, authority, correction and the capacity to refuse.\nPrimary request: Ethereal crystalline light-lattice / luminous non-humanoid geometry, combining an intimate photorealistic human interior with highly stylized generative light architecture.\nScene/backdrop: a quiet bedroom at night, soft warm bedside lamplight, natural linen and lace textures.\nSubject: a clearly adult person in modest loose pale lace-trimmed sleepwear, relaxed seated pose, natural skin tones, seen in intimate editorial three-quarter profile; nearby a completely non-anthropomorphic, self-illuminated structure made of translucent swirling filament ribbons, interlocking arcs and glowing nodes. The luminous structure has no head, face, eyes, limbs, humanoid silhouette or solid creature body.\nStyle/medium: photorealistic human and room fused with delicate mystical science-fiction light architecture; organic and architectural overlapping transparent layers, radiant crystalline geometry.\nComposition/framing: wide cinematic landscape composition, human and living-light geometry share the space at equal scale; the arcs remain open, with visible space and a clear unblocked route out of the scene. Closeness and difference, gentle awe.\nLighting/mood: warm ambient bedroom light against bioluminescent violet, purple, amber, gold and cool blue filaments; restrained bloom, fine luminous detail, subtle volumetric light, tactile real fabric.\nConstraints: no erotic pose or nudity, no machinery or hard sci-fi armor, no humanoid robot, no religious icon as a substitute for geometry, no enclosing cage, no text, no logos or watermark.\n")
